## Copy length guidelines

| Element | Length |
|---|---|
| Page title | < 60 characters |
| Meta description | 140–160 characters |
| Hero headline | 4–8 words |
| Hero subheadline | 1–2 short sentences |
| Section headline | 3–7 words |
| CTA button | 2–4 words |
| Card description | 1–3 sentences |
